    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>This intricate mask is made of gold-plated iron. Writhing snake tails radiate from a gemstone upon the brow, almost as if they were medusa-like hair. Wearing the mask grants a +1 item bonus to Will saves and Perception checks against spells with the Visual trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate </strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">D</span><strong> </strong>envision; <strong>Frequency </strong>Once per day; <strong>Effect </strong>The mask casts a @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.znv4ECL7ZtuiagtA]{Flesh to Stone} spell with a DC of 24, but the resulting petrification effect only lasts for 1 minute instead of permanently.</p>",
